{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1383","id":3996736927,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87uOV2f","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1383","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1383.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1383.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1383","number":1383,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[SEM-KG-CODEX-HVY-00] Freeze Codex-native semantic content boundary","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Freezes the #1362 Codex-native semantic content boundary in a reproducible artifact set.\n- Adds `semantic-kg-codex-native-content-boundary` JSON, validator result, and readback with source artifact paths, current SHA, non-goals, V1-safe predicates, high-risk exclusions, downstream issue order, and the prior SEM-KG-HVY accepted/provisional baseline of `0/0`.\n- Adds a focused builder and Jest coverage for the boundary invariants and missing-source fail-closed behavior.\n\n## Boundary\n\n- Codex-native means AO/Codex workers produce structured semantic shard artifacts through checked-in PRs.\n- It does not mean scripts call external model APIs.\n- External LLM/API backends remain optional, disabled by default, and require fresh explicit authorization.\n- Raw Codex-authored outputs still require validation and promotion before accepted/provisional status.\n- Review backlog must not block V1-safe accepted/provisional content.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-codex-native-boundary.mjs --write` -> validator `pass`, 13/13 checks, accepted `0`, provisional_safe `0`, review_required `3`, blocked_quarantined `3527`.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-codex-native-boundary.test.js` -> PASS, 2 tests.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> exit 0, clean worktree, artifact guard healthy; warning only for branch naming scope and branch being ahead before push.\n\nCloses #1362\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T07:05:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T07:15:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T07:15:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T07:15:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"066df5d40c713c54c13a1b57bc62fee2361fa798","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1383/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1383/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1383/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/83271ca264d7e88f249f2cf09054a2e57062e8bc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/1362","ref":"feat/1362","sha":"83271ca264d7e88f249f2cf09054a2e57062e8bc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":